WEBVTT

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:06.958
[grunting]

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:09.375
[all grunting]

00:00:09.458 --> 00:00:11.958
-[hyperventilating]
-[heart palpitating]

00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:14.791
[whistle blows]

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:17.000
[coach] Okay,
let's take a breather!

00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:24.583
-[Joy gasps]
-[buttons clacking]

00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:30.250
-Sadness!
-Joy! Help!

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.791
[all grunting]

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:33.666
Come on! We can do this!

00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:36.083
It's not working!

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:37.250
It's Anxiety.

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:39.833
[Joy groans in frustration]

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.291
[grunting]

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.333
[strains, grunts, yells]

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.166
Anxiety, stop! [gasps]

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:05.125
You don't get to choose
who Riley is.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.333
Anxiety...

00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:19.250
you need to let her go.

00:01:26.541 --> 00:01:27.541
[grunts]

00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:38.541
[panting]

00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:43.208
[Sense of Self warbles]

00:01:43.291 --> 00:01:45.291
[Riley echoing]
I'm a good person.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.625
-[breathing heavily]
-[heart palpitating rapidly]

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.416
[Anxiety] Joy.

00:01:58.208 --> 00:01:59.500
I'm sorry.

00:02:00.875 --> 00:02:03.625
I was just
trying to protect her.

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:06.625
But you're right.

00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:11.125
We don't get to choose
who Riley is.

00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:19.708
We keep the best
and toss the rest.

00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:33.083
-[blows whistle]
-Twenty-eight!

00:02:33.166 --> 00:02:34.208
Andersen, tripping!

00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:35.750
[trilling]

00:02:38.416 --> 00:02:40.208
[Riley grunts]

00:02:41.125 --> 00:02:42.541
[screams]

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:45.166
[trilling intensifies]

00:02:46.375 --> 00:02:48.375
-[groaning]
-[heart palpitating rapidly]

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.291
[warbling]

00:02:57.875 --> 00:02:59.541
[Riley echoing]
I'm a good person.

00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:06.916
[shatters]

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.458
Joy! What are you doing?

00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:10.541
-[breathing rapidly]
-[heart palpitating rapidly]

00:03:19.916 --> 00:03:21.208
[Riley echoing]
I'm selfish.

00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:23.583
I'm kind.

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:26.833
I'm not good enough.

00:03:27.875 --> 00:03:29.458
I'm a good person.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.041
-I need to fit in...
-[panting]

00:03:32.125 --> 00:03:34.000
[Riley]
...but I want to be myself.

00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:36.458
I'm brave, but I get scared.

00:03:36.625 --> 00:03:38.500
Success is everything.
I make mistakes.

00:03:38.583 --> 00:03:39.750
I'm nice.
I'm mean.

00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:40.833
I'm a good friend.

00:03:40.916 --> 00:03:41.916
I'm a terrible friend.
I am strong.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.666
I'm weak.
I need help sometimes.

00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:45.875
-[breathing rapidly]
-[palpitations recede]

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:47.166
[exhales]

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:48.375
[gasps]

00:03:55.666 --> 00:03:58.375
[breathing rapidly]

00:04:06.875 --> 00:04:07.875
[exhales]

00:04:17.208 --> 00:04:19.208
[inhales deeply, exhales]

00:04:32.541 --> 00:04:34.208
[players clamoring]

00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:39.208
[sighs]

00:04:41.416 --> 00:04:42.416
[door opens]

00:04:42.791 --> 00:04:45.208
Riley, you okay?

00:04:53.625 --> 00:04:54.958
Yeah.

00:04:55.041 --> 00:04:57.458
I mean... no.

00:05:01.083 --> 00:05:03.416
I was such a jerk to you guys.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.500
When you guys told me you were
going to a different school,

00:05:07.583 --> 00:05:08.791
I freaked out.

00:05:08.958 --> 00:05:10.791
And... [sighs]

00:05:12.875 --> 00:05:14.125
I'm so sorry.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.666
If you don't want to
be friends anymore...

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.000
I get it.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.125
But...

00:05:23.291 --> 00:05:25.375
I really hope that
you can forgive me.

00:05:26.791 --> 00:05:27.875
Someday.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.250
[♪ hopeful music playing]

00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:55.625
[coach blows whistle]

00:05:55.708 --> 00:05:56.833
-[coach] Let's go, ladies!
-Come on.

00:05:56.916 --> 00:05:58.500
We've got a game to finish.

00:06:11.083 --> 00:06:13.541
[faint chiming, clinking]

00:06:13.625 --> 00:06:14.625
[gasps]

00:06:27.458 --> 00:06:28.458
Joy...

00:06:28.875 --> 00:06:30.916
Riley wants you.

